WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:38.090 --> 01:41.200
Is it okay to eat so many apples?

01:41.200 --> 01:43.670
You won't be able to make the apple pie.

01:43.670 --> 01:45.780
Oh, it's fine.

01:46.100 --> 01:50.790
Even if there aren't enough apples, I'm sure
that Vanilla will manage somehow.

01:50.790 --> 01:52.300
Really?

01:54.980 --> 01:56.080
Pierre...

01:56.610 --> 01:58.210
I'm going to hide!

02:05.620 --> 02:08.890
Pierre, you're eating alone in a place like this?

02:09.520 --> 02:10.560
Aren't you lonely?

02:12.990 --> 02:14.280
If you say I'm lonely...

02:16.330 --> 02:19.370
If you say I'm lonely, won't you
eat these carrots for me?

02:19.930 --> 02:21.170
Carrots?

02:21.170 --> 02:23.910
Yes. I can't eat them.

02:24.270 --> 02:26.670
Oh, yeah. You said you hate carrots.

02:27.810 --> 02:29.370
So you remembered?

02:30.010 --> 02:30.880
Thank you.

02:32.280 --> 02:37.890
Don't make a mistake, I hate people who
won't eat carrots like a little kid.

02:39.950 --> 02:41.790
Well, that's too bad.

02:42.290 --> 02:42.820
See ya.

02:44.730 --> 02:46.690
Will you eat lunch with me tomorrow?

02:48.530 --> 02:50.660
It's lonely by myself, see.

02:52.270 --> 02:56.600
You aren't alone. You're always
surrounded by your Members.

03:02.480 --> 03:04.010
Thank you very much.

03:10.080 --> 03:12.520
Chocolat-chan, they had baguettes?

03:12.520 --> 03:13.960
Yeah, they had them.

03:14.790 --> 03:16.460
You know, I just met Pierre.

03:17.030 --> 03:18.330
Really?

03:18.330 --> 03:22.360
He was eating all by himself, but
he couldn't eat the carrots.

03:22.360 --> 03:24.000
What an idiot!

03:25.430 --> 03:26.900
Chocolat-chan...

03:26.900 --> 03:28.970
What? What is it, Vanilla?

03:28.970 --> 03:32.740
Your heart, Chocolat-chan...
It's glowing orange again!

03:35.740 --> 03:38.910
Pierre's secret, the diary's secret.

03:41.020 --> 03:43.360
There is someone from the Magical
World in our school?

03:43.750 --> 03:47.120
Yes, there are others who come
here from the Magical World.

03:47.560 --> 03:49.590
Most of them are friends.

03:49.590 --> 03:55.260
I wish that they weren't our enemy, but
the people who are in your school,

03:55.260 --> 03:59.200
they are called "Ogres" and they are
a race who wishes to oppose us.

03:59.670 --> 04:00.320
Ogres...

04:04.140 --> 04:07.040
A race who opposes us.

04:07.580 --> 04:11.510
So the black, icy shadow that Queen
Candy was talking about was...

04:11.510 --> 04:13.020
about them, right?

04:13.550 --> 04:16.020
I think it has to be Pierre!

04:16.780 --> 04:20.120
He's been aiming for you, Chocolat-chan.

04:20.120 --> 04:22.700
Chocolat... You've been targeted?

04:22.700 --> 04:24.930
So it is that guy.

04:24.930 --> 04:27.130
We won't let him get near Chocolat again!

04:27.130 --> 04:29.960
Man. I realized that a long time ago!

04:30.670 --> 04:33.580
I mean, why else would he try and get near me?

04:33.580 --> 04:36.460
Well, in that case, I'll be the one to find him out!

04:36.800 --> 04:40.170
Do you realize how dangerous that is?

04:40.810 --> 04:43.420
If he takes your heart, your life will be gone.

04:43.810 --> 04:49.380
That's right, Chocolat-chan! Even today,
didn't your heart come out?

04:49.380 --> 04:53.960
Hey, now, everyone! Don't go thinking
he'll take my heart first!

04:53.960 --> 04:57.440
I'm gonna be the one to take his first, just you wait.

04:57.760 --> 05:03.630
Chocolat, be careful. Even if Pierre
isn't an Ogre and is only a human,

05:04.170 --> 05:07.200
if you truly fall in love and your heart turns red,

05:07.200 --> 05:11.040
you'll have no choice but to give
your one and only heart to him.

05:11.740 --> 05:16.870
Like... I... said... I'm totally going
to take his heart first, instead!

05:18.110 --> 05:23.480
Chocolat-chan, we're really worried about you so please promise not to go too far, okay?

05:25.420 --> 05:26.490
Fine...

05:28.390 --> 05:32.340
I wonder what Mama would do at a time like this?

05:33.030 --> 05:35.600
Pierre is from the Magical World...

05:35.600 --> 05:37.630
If that's really the case,

05:37.630 --> 05:43.140
then Pierre probably realized I came from the Magical World from the start.

05:44.740 --> 05:47.770
That time... And today too...

05:49.510 --> 05:53.410
Wait. If he was really aiming for my heart...

05:53.780 --> 05:59.420
If a witch has her heart taken by a magic user, her soul will be gone for all eternity.

05:59.790 --> 06:03.760
That means, you'd die, right?

06:03.760 --> 06:09.030
What? Then is Pierre trying to kill me or something?

06:09.030 --> 06:10.900
And smiling the whole time, even.

06:11.170 --> 06:15.000
And I just thought he was easy-going and acted cool.

06:16.840 --> 06:19.010
Argh, this is so annoying!

06:20.270 --> 06:24.160
Pierre invited you to his private lunch room?

06:24.580 --> 06:28.880
Then he might seriously ask
you to become a Member.

06:28.880 --> 06:30.450
Become a Member?

06:30.450 --> 06:34.490
Chocolat... If you become a Member,
will you introduce us?

06:34.920 --> 06:39.390
Fine, whatever. This is all ridiculous
anyway. I ain't going.

06:39.390 --> 06:42.030
Eh? What a waste!

06:42.030 --> 06:43.870
I'll go in your place!

06:43.870 --> 06:46.900
You might have been able to become a Member!

06:48.540 --> 06:52.010
Thank goodness... Chocolat-chan decided not to go.

06:55.040 --> 07:00.010
Pierre-sama... It seems the girl
you asked is not coming.

07:04.420 --> 07:07.040
The Prince asked her to lunch?

07:07.320 --> 07:09.820
And she stood him up, at that!

07:09.820 --> 07:11.630
How dare she!

07:11.630 --> 07:14.560
For Chocolat to show the Prince such contempt...

07:21.900 --> 07:23.210
Chocolat Kato-san...

07:24.010 --> 07:24.710
What?

07:25.140 --> 07:29.310
It seems like you didn't go to the
lunch the Prince invited you to.

07:29.310 --> 07:31.780
So your point is... Got a problem with that?

07:31.780 --> 07:36.720
That's right... These people probably
don't know Pierre's real identity.

07:37.020 --> 07:39.280
We came to check on something.

07:39.280 --> 07:43.990
To see what kind of person would refuse the Prince's invitation.

07:43.990 --> 07:45.940
It doesn't have anything to do with you guys.

07:46.390 --> 07:47.660
What did you say?

07:47.660 --> 07:49.090
What are you doing?

07:50.600 --> 07:51.600
Prince...

07:52.070 --> 07:53.950
What are you doing, everyone?

07:54.240 --> 07:56.370
We were just, um...

07:56.370 --> 08:00.710
You weren't bullying Chocolat, were you?

08:01.910 --> 08:05.410
We'd never do something like that, Prince.

08:05.410 --> 08:08.300
We just wanted to talk with her.

08:08.720 --> 08:11.090
I see. Fine then.

08:11.790 --> 08:18.030
I am interested in her. So I hope
you will all support me.

08:18.030 --> 08:22.530
Of course, Prince.
Isn't that right, everyone?

08:22.530 --> 08:23.890
S-Sure...

08:24.570 --> 08:27.670
Good. You're always correct.

08:28.940 --> 08:31.570
If you say so, I'll believe it.

08:32.910 --> 08:33.650
Now, if you'll excuse me.

08:39.350 --> 08:43.250
Chocolat, be careful! I can feel the presence of noir!

08:45.650 --> 08:47.020
A black heart?

08:47.660 --> 08:51.730
It's the black heart that comes
from the darkness of jealousy!

08:51.730 --> 08:54.630
Chocolat, the noir destroys everything.

08:54.630 --> 08:59.070
It's different from other hearts:
if someone takes one, they'll die!

08:59.070 --> 09:01.400
Ack! What's with that frog?

09:01.400 --> 09:03.140
And what a disgusting color!

09:03.140 --> 09:04.310
What'd you say?!

09:04.310 --> 09:07.040
I won't let you bad-mouth my color!

09:11.280 --> 09:12.350
Chocolat.

09:12.350 --> 09:13.030
What?

09:13.850 --> 09:18.750
Answer me honestly. Why did you
refuse the Prince's invitation?

09:18.750 --> 09:19.950
Why?

09:20.550 --> 09:22.490
'Cause I didn't want to go.

09:22.490 --> 09:27.360
I see. So, you don't want to
become a Member, right?

09:27.360 --> 09:31.090
Then please don't come close to the Prince anymore.

09:32.600 --> 09:33.070
Yurika!

09:35.070 --> 09:35.800
What is it?

09:36.340 --> 09:38.800
You too, Yurika. Don't get too close to Pierre.

09:41.540 --> 09:42.310
Why not?

09:42.880 --> 09:45.080
I'm worried about you, Yurika.

09:46.080 --> 09:49.780
I have a bad feeling about that black heart.

09:50.450 --> 09:52.190
Mind your own business.

09:52.620 --> 09:57.090
Are you trying to push me away from the Prince so you can have him all to yourself?

09:57.090 --> 09:57.820
No, I'm not...

09:58.330 --> 10:02.730
As the leader of the Members,
I will only act appropriately.

10:03.360 --> 10:06.330
You have no right to speak to me like that.

10:06.330 --> 10:08.540
Yurika, please, listen!

10:08.540 --> 10:12.470
Stop it. Don't call me "Yurika''
anymore, it's unpleasant.

10:13.470 --> 10:18.550
I thought that I might become good friends
with you, but it seems I thought too much.

10:18.950 --> 10:20.480
Goodbye, Kato-san.

10:22.850 --> 10:24.080
Yurika...

10:29.390 --> 10:34.060
If it's carried inside her, then it's probably
eating away at her soul.

10:34.060 --> 10:35.400
That black heart...

10:36.030 --> 10:41.590
Because of Pierre, that heart of jealousy and
hatred is growing inside of the Members.

10:42.100 --> 10:46.110
It's no good, I can't drive out those feelings.

10:46.710 --> 10:50.310
Pierre... Why are you doing that
to Yurika and the others?

10:50.310 --> 10:52.590
Because Pierre is really an Ogre?

10:52.980 --> 10:54.710
What's the matter, Chocolat?

10:57.490 --> 11:00.790
That serious face doesn't suit you, Chocolat.

11:00.790 --> 11:02.120
It's because of Pierre, isn't it?

11:02.590 --> 11:03.090
Yeah.

11:04.160 --> 11:06.960
We're also looking for the guy.

11:06.960 --> 11:10.400
Queen Candy told us to protect you, after all.

11:10.400 --> 11:14.690
Will you protect everyone from Pierre,
and not just me and Vanilla?

11:15.200 --> 11:16.370
You mean the Members?

11:16.940 --> 11:21.310
Okay! With our charm, well make
them totally forget about Pierre!

11:21.310 --> 11:23.660
And then we'll reveal his true nature!

11:37.830 --> 11:39.530
Alright!

11:50.540 --> 11:51.670
Saule-kun...

11:51.670 --> 11:52.610
What is it?

11:53.110 --> 11:55.340
Since you seemed a bit bored...

11:55.840 --> 11:57.340
We just couldn't leave you alone.

11:58.080 --> 12:00.150
What are you going on about?

12:00.650 --> 12:04.480
For beautiful women like yourselves to be bored...

12:04.920 --> 12:07.020
That's something we can't ignore.

12:07.960 --> 12:10.160
Beautiful women?

12:10.160 --> 12:11.500
You mean us?

12:11.930 --> 12:13.490
Let's not talk here.

12:13.930 --> 12:16.760
I'd rather talk in a more beautiful place.

12:17.430 --> 12:18.700
Here, go ahead.

12:19.270 --> 12:21.600
Welcome to our secret garden.

12:25.040 --> 12:26.410
It's so beautiful!

12:26.410 --> 12:29.280
Was there really such a wonderful
place at our school?

12:29.940 --> 12:33.250
If you have anything else you wish for, just ask.

12:33.250 --> 12:37.350
Let's see... I'd love some delicious tea and snacks.

12:42.160 --> 12:43.360
Here, go ahead.

12:44.130 --> 12:45.130
Wonderful!

12:45.130 --> 12:47.260
It wasn't there before...

12:47.260 --> 12:48.870
It's like magic, or something!

12:49.400 --> 12:50.130
Isn't it?

12:59.610 --> 13:04.310
I didn't realize that you were such
fun people, Houx-kun, Saule-kun.

13:04.310 --> 13:05.410
Yeah!

13:05.410 --> 13:08.820
To see you all laughing is wonderful.

13:10.420 --> 13:11.560
Thank you.

13:11.920 --> 13:14.050
Well, the Prince is wonderful...

13:14.050 --> 13:16.270
But Houx-kun, Saule-kun... You're wonderful too.

13:16.820 --> 13:18.230
Thank you.

13:18.230 --> 13:21.300
Hey, I have something I'd like to know, though.

13:21.300 --> 13:22.280
What might it be?

13:23.030 --> 13:24.780
Will you tell us about Pierre?

13:25.730 --> 13:28.620
About the Prince? What do you want to know?

13:29.100 --> 13:30.870
About his personality...

13:30.870 --> 13:33.470
What he likes, what he dislikes...

13:33.470 --> 13:40.550
I see. He has a kind personality,
but he can be strict as well.

13:40.550 --> 13:42.220
I like that about him, though.

13:42.220 --> 13:43.780
I see. And...?

13:43.780 --> 13:46.470
And the things he likes are...

13:49.860 --> 13:50.620
The roses...

13:52.430 --> 13:53.640
The roses are drying up.

13:54.030 --> 13:55.460
Oh, no. They are...

13:57.500 --> 13:59.670
What? This is gross.

14:00.970 --> 14:04.650
And anyway, it's strange that you want
to know so much about the Prince.

14:04.910 --> 14:08.490
Yes. Somehow, I'm suddenly
tired of this conversation.

14:08.910 --> 14:11.050
Oh, my. Look at the time.

14:11.050 --> 14:12.580
Let's go back, everyone.

14:12.580 --> 14:13.850
Yes, let's.

14:15.880 --> 14:18.000
What happened?

14:18.420 --> 14:23.220
It's true. The second we started to hear about
the guy, the magic suddenly disappeared.

14:23.720 --> 14:26.410
Sorry we couldn't be any more help, Chocolat.

14:26.790 --> 14:28.930
Nah. Thanks, you guys.

14:30.870 --> 14:37.070
So Pierre invited me on purpose
to create those blacks hearts.

14:37.070 --> 14:40.170
Which means he was just using me?

14:40.610 --> 14:42.280
I don't know.

14:42.280 --> 14:44.550
They've been doing this for ages.

14:44.550 --> 14:47.150
They won't show themselves that easily.

14:49.480 --> 14:51.680
Mama, what should I do?

14:52.190 --> 14:54.650
If it were you, Mama, what would you do?

14:55.290 --> 14:58.390
I wonder if there's any way I can read Mama's diary?

14:59.430 --> 15:02.170
That's it! This!

15:02.560 --> 15:07.530
1,2,3,4,5,6!

15:07.530 --> 15:09.140
Sugar Sugar Rune!

15:14.910 --> 15:16.980
Here's your transparent plate.

15:16.980 --> 15:18.780
That'll be 500 ecure.

15:18.780 --> 15:20.950
500 ecure?! That's expensive!

15:20.950 --> 15:25.480
You'll only be able to see the first page of a diary.

15:25.890 --> 15:28.030
And it's a one-time use item, too.

15:28.320 --> 15:31.030
One-time use? For 500 ecure?

15:31.030 --> 15:33.070
Okay, come again!

15:33.430 --> 15:35.900
Maybe I screwed up again.

15:35.900 --> 15:38.290
But if I can read even one page...

15:39.030 --> 15:42.300
I'm sure that Mama should be
able to teach me something.

15:45.640 --> 15:49.380
Mama, what are you trying to tell me?

15:53.480 --> 15:56.120
To Chocolat when you are older.

15:56.120 --> 15:57.220
Mama's voice?

16:05.560 --> 16:09.660
My daughter... You've probably already grown up.

16:10.730 --> 16:13.900
And maybe you are in the Human
World just like I was?

16:14.540 --> 16:17.040
It'd be nice if you were as popular as I was.

16:17.940 --> 16:22.380
Mama!! I'm not that way at all!

16:22.380 --> 16:25.110
Please, tell me how to be popular!

16:25.110 --> 16:27.580
Even if you speak to the diary,
you won't get an answer.

16:28.920 --> 16:33.380
Instead, I will tell you the most important
thing about being a Queen.

16:34.150 --> 16:38.960
Do not forget to be thankful for every
person that you receive a heart from.

16:38.960 --> 16:42.760
Kiss everyone who loves you from
the bottom of your heart.

16:42.760 --> 16:45.160
A kiss of thanks?

16:45.600 --> 16:49.140
Do not forget that, Princess.

16:51.210 --> 16:53.210
Mama, wait!

16:53.210 --> 16:56.080
Tell me more, about the Ogres, and...

16:58.650 --> 16:59.380
It disappeared.

17:01.020 --> 17:02.370
Mama!

17:03.580 --> 17:06.920
But, I met you... I've never known
anything but your picture.

17:07.650 --> 17:10.260
Your voice, your face...

17:12.130 --> 17:14.860
Mama, I'm gonna do my best.

17:14.860 --> 17:17.080
I'm not gonna lose to those Ogres.

17:17.430 --> 17:23.100
If Pierre's really an Ogre, I can't just leave
him alone, for everyone's sake!

17:23.670 --> 17:24.400
Good morning.

17:27.110 --> 17:27.770
Good morning.

17:29.110 --> 17:30.080
Chocolat-chan.

17:30.640 --> 17:32.280
It'll be okay, Vanilla.

17:32.850 --> 17:33.610
You're cruel.

17:34.250 --> 17:35.010
Why?

17:35.580 --> 17:37.320
I waited for you all day yesterday.

17:37.580 --> 17:40.050
I never promised you I'd go.

17:40.520 --> 17:42.260
You never said you wouldn't go, either.

17:43.890 --> 17:49.330
Well, I did want to go, but I thought there
would be someone else there.

17:49.330 --> 17:51.750
So that's why I didn't go.

17:52.130 --> 17:56.260
Total lie. Now well see who's playing tricks.

17:57.770 --> 17:59.010
I only invited you.

18:01.080 --> 18:02.570
Fine, then let's try this from scratch.

18:02.570 --> 18:05.520
Would you like to eat lunch together today, just the two of us?

18:06.750 --> 18:10.950
Crap, his cold face is
just like the Ice Prince's...

18:11.820 --> 18:14.050
No, I can't... I can't lose to him.

18:14.660 --> 18:16.020
Got it, fine.

18:16.820 --> 18:19.090
Good. I'll be waiting.

18:23.560 --> 18:26.200
I'll find out your true identity!

18:28.500 --> 18:30.070
Chocolat, going to the cafe?

18:30.540 --> 18:33.170
No, I have some stuff I have to do.

18:33.510 --> 18:35.780
Oh, really? That's too bad.

18:35.780 --> 18:37.410
I'll show up later.

18:37.410 --> 18:39.010
Okay, we'll be waiting for you.

18:39.010 --> 18:39.550
Sure.

18:41.580 --> 18:45.220
I'll confront Pierre, and take away his heart!

18:50.220 --> 18:53.320
Oh, Kato-san, where might you be going?

18:53.690 --> 18:56.930
Where I'm going is none of your business.

18:56.930 --> 18:58.800
How dare you say that to us!

19:00.930 --> 19:04.910
Only those who we choose may pass through here.

19:04.910 --> 19:07.710
We won't allow you to go to where the Prince is!

19:07.710 --> 19:11.000
For you to have lunch alone
together with the Prince...

19:11.350 --> 19:13.000
We'll never allow it!

19:15.450 --> 19:19.120
It seems everyone is being controlled
by the noir hearts.

19:20.690 --> 19:21.510
Duke...

19:22.090 --> 19:23.920
What's the deal with the frog?

19:23.920 --> 19:25.890
We're not scared of him anymore!

19:25.890 --> 19:27.560
Oh? Then, how about now!

19:28.230 --> 19:30.830
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

19:39.410 --> 19:40.910
So many!

19:40.910 --> 19:42.680
I'm scared!

19:42.680 --> 19:43.910
Don't come near me!

19:45.180 --> 19:47.680
Sorry, it's for your own good.

19:53.820 --> 19:55.290
It's got to be in there.

20:06.000 --> 20:07.430
There's no one here?

20:07.430 --> 20:09.340
But, he promised...

20:23.150 --> 20:24.020
So, you came.

20:24.520 --> 20:25.850
You didn't think I could come on time?

20:26.290 --> 20:30.330
No, I didn't think you would come at all.

20:31.290 --> 20:33.830
I thought that you would stand me up again.

20:36.400 --> 20:38.600
I'm happy you came.

20:38.600 --> 20:43.370
Got to calm down... if Pierre came trom the
Magical World and is aiming for my heart,

20:43.370 --> 20:45.940
he might be a terrible person!

20:47.110 --> 20:48.170
Will you eat something?

20:48.910 --> 20:50.640
You haven't eaten already?

20:55.180 --> 20:56.150
Training?

21:02.060 --> 21:05.690
Now, now... Don't push yourself.

21:07.090 --> 21:09.600
Those are... carrots?

21:10.130 --> 21:12.830
Pierre is eating carrots?

21:20.070 --> 21:22.840
Pierre, didn't you hate carrots?

21:24.340 --> 21:25.340
I hate them.

21:25.950 --> 21:27.010
Then, why?

21:27.770 --> 21:29.850
You said it earlier...

21:30.380 --> 21:35.620
"I hate people who won't eat carrots like a little kid."

21:37.560 --> 21:42.130
Since you said that, I've been
training myself to eat carrots.

21:46.700 --> 21:50.600
Pierre... is eating carrots... for me?

21:57.330 --> 22:02.150
Why? Why, for me...?

22:06.620 --> 22:08.190
Mama, please teach me...

22:08.190 --> 22:13.560
How do I stop my heart from beating
so fast for a bad guy?

22:23.200 --> 22:29.530
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.620 --> 22:31.030
"Love"

22:31.940 --> 22:35.450
A magic spell.

22:37.580 --> 22:44.860
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.290 --> 22:54.360
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:56.040 --> 23:00.310
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.910 --> 23:03.970
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.280 --> 23:11.350
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.720 --> 23:16.160
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.160 --> 23:26.270
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.330 --> 23:35.240
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:45.680 --> 23:48.410
Everyone, who are you going to spend Christmas with?

23:48.410 --> 23:51.890
We're gonna have a party at my place and go crazy!

23:51.890 --> 23:56.160
Nanako, Natsuma, Akira, Mimura... Everyone's coming over to my place!

23:56.160 --> 23:59.460
Oh crap, I have to clean up my room before they show up!

23:59.460 --> 24:01.160
What a pain...

24:01.690 --> 24:05.350
Oh? Mayu-chan is always staring at Morita.

24:05.350 --> 24:06.170
Maybe...

24:06.790 --> 24:08.720
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.720 --> 24:10.720
Christmas is for Hearts in Love

24:11.370 --> 24:13.700
I'll show everyone a Christmas miracle!
